  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "服務科學與創新",
    "sub_ename": "SERVICE SCIENCE AND INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "整合服務管理、科技、工程及服務設計等領域的課程，並探討跨領域創知識的創新研究與服務模式，以培養學生對於服務經濟與軟實力提升的瞭解與認知。本課程著重在商業流程創新，商業智慧和技術的創新和創業精神，主要內容包括：科技，商業和社會組織等面向，所涉及議題包括：企業流程創新與商業模式建構、服務設計與開發、技術創新、商業智慧、企業與組織文化、消費者行為、企業關係管理、社會資本以及知識管理等範疇。",
    "describe_eh": "Service science and innovation is the study of service systems, and it aims at improving service systems (particularly those involved in complex, IT-enabled services) in terms of the application of scientific, management, and engineering disciplines. This course focuses on business process innovation, business intelligence, and technology innovation and entrepreneurship and consists of three main foci: technology, business, and social-organizational foci.",
